cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use SPACE in your research, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "SPACE: Storage Platform for Adaptive Computational Ecosystems"
abstract: >-
  A single-node capsule store in Rust with an S3-compatible view. Writes
  are compressed, deduplicated by BLAKE3 content hash, and encrypted with
  deterministic XTS-AES-256, so that encryption preserves deduplication.
authors:
  - family-names: Wall
    given-names: Shane
repository-code: https://github.com/saworbit/SPACE
license: BUSL-1.1
keywords:
  - storage
  - deduplication
  - encryption
  - s3
  - rust
